  "paragraphs": [
   "JustFOIA sells software for handling public records requests, from intake through delivery. The home page calls the product FOIA request management software. The same page lists product features including a public portal for submitting, tracking, and searching requests.",
   "The case studies page addresses agencies saving time in their communities. Case study titles name Bay County, Greeley Police, Mead School District, and the City of Irving.",
   "The home page says public-facing pages are audited for 508 compliance by a third-party. A form on that page invites a demo request, and the page states that the company does not process records requests for individuals."
